11
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
One More Shot (also known as One Shot 2) is a 2024 action thriller film.

12
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
It is a direct sequel to One Shot (2021), and is
followed by One Last Shot (2026).

13
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
The film was directed by James Nunn and starring Scott Adkins,
Michael Jai White, Alexis Knapp, and Tom Berenger.

14
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
Like the original, it is edited to appear as if
shot in a single, continuous take.

15
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The film explores themes of affectation, hostile,
intense, antagonistic, appreciative.

16
01:36:00,000 --> 01:36:06,000
